notes: >
  Public repository supporting an MEng final-year thesis: thesis-specific analysis and
  plotting code, processed results, report figures, provenance documentation and
  representative videos, to support inspection and reproducibility of the reported
  figures. Not a general-purpose crowd-simulation package. The simulation core is
  third-party (Farkas–Helbing–Vicsek "panic" package) and is not relicensed or
  redistributed here — see LICENSE_OR_NOTICE.md.
